ears and shafts, gearbox housings, shaft and shell assemblies, and clutch modules; and engines, including cylinder blocks and heads, connecting rods, camshafts, and balance shaft modules for battery, hybrid, and fuel-cell electric vehicles. This segment serves electrified and traditionally powered markets. The Industrial segment provides scissor, boom and telehandler lifts for the aerial work platform industry; combine draper headers and self-propelled windrowers for the agricultural harvesting industry; farm tillage and crop fertilizer applicator equipment; and air seeders, cultivators, and planters for the seeding and farming industry. The company also provides medical devices and precision medical components. It offers its products under the Linamar, Skyjack, MacDon, Salford, Bourgault, and McLaren Engineering brand names. Linamar Corporation was founded in 1964 and is headquartered in Guelph, Canada.", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "industry": "Auto Parts"}, "valuation": {"pe": 9.799047, "pb": 0.96522415, "ps": 0.57265073, "roe": 10.51, "net_margin": 5.9, "debt_to_equity": null, "div_yield": 1.13, "rev_growth": 5.5, "market_cap": 6092496384.0, "forward_pe": 7.7534394, "peg": null, "payout": 11.05, "five_yr_yield": 1.33, "pe_sector_med": 27.068047, "pb_sector_med": 6.8998218, "roe_sector_med": 28.14, "div_yield_sector_med": 1.86}, "archetype": "mixed", "archetype_label": "Mixed profile", "archetype_label_zh": "\u6df7\u5408\u7279\u5f81", "consensus": {"n_analysts": 6, "target_mean": 105.33333, "target_high": 119.0, "target_low": 99.0, "rating_mean": null, "upside_pct": 2.4}, "positioning": {"shares_short": 534850.0, "days_to_cover": 4.34, "short_pct_float": null, "held_insiders": 36.01, "held_institutions": 22.4}}, "earnings": {"next_date": "2026-08-12", "surprises": [{"date": "2026-05-05", "eps": 3.28, "est": 2.81, "surprise_pct": 16.8}, {"date": "2026-03-04", "eps": 2.28, "est": 1.99, "surprise_pct": 14.8}, {"date": "2025-11-12", "eps": 2.51, "est": 2.41, "surp